B.QD=new A.b1("prophet-musa-1","Dua of Prophet Musa for Confidence & Ease","Before Public Speaking, Exams & Trials",u.m,"Rabbish-rah lee sadree wa yassir lee amree wahlul 'uqdatam-mil-lisanee yafqahoo qawlee","My Lord! Expand for me my breast [with confidence], and ease for me my task, and untie the knot from my tongue, that they may understand my speech.","Surah Ta-Ha 20:25-28",3,"Recited before important speeches, interviews, exams, and daunting tasks for clarity, peace, and eloquence.",null,B.a6r)
