B.QY=new A.b1("prophet-zakariya","Dua of Prophet Zakariya for Righteous Children","For Fertility, Heirs and Pious Offspring",u.I,"Rabbi la tadharn\u012b fardan wa Anta khayrul-waritheen","My Lord, do not leave me alone [with no heir], while You are the best of inheritors.","Surah Al-Anbiya 21:89",7,"Supplicated by Prophet Zakariya in his old age; Allah blessed him with Yahya. Recommended for couples desiring children.",null,B.a1V)
