B.QZ=new A.b1("prophet-ibrahim-1","Dua of Prophet Ibrahim for Prayer & Offspring","Steadfastness in Salah for You and Your Children",u.H,"Rabbij'alnee muqeemas-Salati wa min dhurriyyatee; Rabbana wa taqabbal du'aa","My Lord, make me an establisher of prayer, and [many] from my descendants. Our Lord, and accept my supplication.","Surah Ibrahim 14:40",3,"Essential supplication for spiritual consistency and protecting one's family lineage upon faith and prayer.",null,B.a4t)
