B.aa8=new A.ai(B.jJ,["Day 2 (9th Dhul Hijjah)","Day of Arafah (The Peak)","Travel to plains of Arafah after Fajr. Stand before Allah in earnest prayer, dua, & repentance until sunset. This is the greatest pillar of Hajj."],t.l)
